{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorN6SyUPM3Gz9Pkxsiv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll tell you straight: this page answers the question exactly, and the answer is \"a lot\". Every item on it carries a small red tag, \"לא מחושב\". Under the title \"מה האתר עוד לא מכסה\" it says \"החוקים והכללים לכל המוצרים כאן עוד בבדיקה. עד שייסגרו, האתר לא מחשב אותם.\" So I can't rely on this site for any of these things yet.\n\nThe ones that matter to me: \"פיקדון מובנה\", \"מוצר מובנה\", \"פיקדון בבנק במטבע זר\", \"צמוד דולר\", the \"מענק\" on a deposit, government bonds (\"אגרת בונדס\"), company bonds (\"אג\"ח קונצרניות\"), \"ביטוח מנהלים\", \"ביטוח חיים משתתף ברווחים\" and the life-insurance savings policy (\"פוליסת ביטוח חיים שמשמשת לחיסכון\"). I don't think I saw an ordinary plain bank deposit in the list, though I didn't reach the bottom of the page. I'm fairly sure of this much. I'll ask you or the bank before I decide anything.\n\n**What I looked at:** The top screen with the title and the red box, then the cards one after another. Each card has a name and a few lines under \"מה ידוע\". On a few cards there was a \"מצב הכיסוי\" part with \"שאלה פתוחה\". One open question was about tax on foreign-currency deposits. Another asked whether the savings policy can have no interest at all. I read six screens and then stopped, because my eyes were tired. I didn't get to screens 7 to 10.\n\n**What I skipped:** ETC, LBMA Gold, gold, \"ארנק מט\"ח דיגיטלי\", \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\", \"חברת דירוג\" and \"ניירות ערך מסחריים\". The law references and dates in blue and grey I didn't read.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"ETC\", \"LBMA Gold Price AM / PM\", \"קרנות סל\", \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\", \"TX2-01\", \"TXA-28\" and \"MF-28\". I'm also not sure what \"לפי החברה\" means in the orange tag, or the crossed-out \"נסגר ב־\" dates. A lot of the small grey writing on the black background I couldn't read properly.\n\n**Wh